---
import ChapterLayout from '../../../layouts/ChapterLayout.astro';
import { getDrakeChapter } from '../../../data/story/drakeChaptersData';
import { processDrakeContentHtml } from '../../../utils/drakeContentProcessor';

const chapter = getDrakeChapter('013-light', 'chapter-8')!;

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;

const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Part 17! Hey, my birthday was August 17th! Cosmic...no, not really actually.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#The_Thief_Steals_The_Show\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Thief Steals The Show</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#The_Trap\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Trap</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Reunion\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reunion</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Plan_B\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Plan B</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#You&#39;re_Not_Alone\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">You're Not Alone</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Thief_Steals_The_Show\">The Thief Steals The Show</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Thief Steals The Show\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_17?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Thief Steals The Show\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Another new character, we're running out of them eh?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>PLAYABLE CHARACTER - <b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Zidane_Tribal_(Dissidia_PSP)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Zidane Tribal (Dissidia PSP)\">Zidane</a></b>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/11/Dissidia_Zidane.png/revision/latest?cb=20101216073836\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dissidia Zidane\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/11/Dissidia_Zidane.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20101216073836\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"219\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dissidia Zidane.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissidia_Zidane.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The monkey-boy thief is here! Zidane is my favorite hero in the series, just barely outranking Terra. While other heroes are bland, annoying and/or angsty, Zidane is cool, friendly, laid-back and witty, not to mention being a rampant flirt. He does have his hesitations and insecurities, but he deals with them better than so many other character, overcompensating for them instead of being emotionally crippled. Overall he's just a really cool guy, characters like Cloud and Squall are ones you might enjoy doing a thesis on for a psychology class. Zidane is the character you'd enjoy going to a party with and just hanging out. Apparently his English voice actor gets some flak, but I like it, totally different from the Japanese VA but I think it works. He sounds better in battle than in cutscenes, he sounds too deep in the latter, but then battles take up the majority of time you listen to the voice actors anyway. And hey, if you want to wield a badass weapon, it doesn't get much more awesome than reverse-gripping two swords that can connect into a dual-bladed sword - just ask Gabranth and Xehanort.\n</p><p>Zidane is, in my humble opinion but this is my walkthrough so I'm right, the best character in the game. He excels at aerial combat, having a decent projectile attack, a diving attack, rising attack, forward spin attack, and a quick close-range keep away attack. His ground moves are limited, but they're so effective they're all he needs, His HP attacks are likewise awesome, he's got a mid-range charge attack, a close-range explosion of energy, and a long-range entrapment attack of lightning and water. He also has HP links to boot. Zidane's \"weakness\" is that he doesn't do a lot of Bravery damage, though this is a bit of an informed attribute to me, he does plenty good damage to kick ass, and when you've got some HP attacks including links, who cares if the Bravery damage is lame, HP damage is what wins battles. Sure he's no Squall or Cloud when it comes to his Bravery game, but he isn't as pathetic as Onion Knight so don't write his Bravery game off as weak - his Booster 8 to Storm Vortex hits just as hard as Squall's Solid Barrel.\n</p><p>Zidane starts out with Rumble Rush on the ground, a quick rolling kick foward that launches the opponent into a chase, Swift Attack which is a quick two-hit close-range move that begins a chase, and Scoop Art, which fires out three slow-moving energy bolts that track the opponent. Don't worry, he'll learn Tempest and Vortex before Level 10, giving him more options in the air. His HP attacks are Tidal Flame, which sends a ring of fireballs spinning along the ground to explode in a fairly wide radius, Free Energy, a very fast but very short range blast of energy, and Shift Break, creating a tempest of lightning strikes around the opponent before blasting them with water, very good for opponents who try to charge up attacks at range, like Starfall, Meltdown, Black Materia, etc.\n</p><p>As I said, I consider Zidane one of the game's best characters, he's my main, and he'll be back for the Epilogue and in Confessions of the Creator, so learn to love him. And you will, he may seem weak now, but once he learns his higher level attacks and gets his HP links, you'll be raining furry Genome death on the opposition.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>I gave Zidane a Sakura, Green Beret, Silken Shirt, and bought him a Chakram. For accessories, Hyper Ring, Muscle Belt, Sunrise, HP = 100%, BRV ≥ Base Value, and Level 1-9. I'm also playing on an AP calendar bonus so I'm getting bonus APs, awesome because Zidane really wants to master Rumble Rush and Swift Attack quickly.\n</p><p>Before I launched the story, I went to Chapter 5 of Treachery of the Gods and bought some stuff from the moogle there, since it was my bonus day and he had special stock for sale. \n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Reaper\"><img alt=\"Capricious Reaper\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/3c/Dissicon_ff5_Bar1.png/revision/latest?cb=20101120015034\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Assist Character\"><img alt=\"Assist Character\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/3c/Dissicon_ff5_Bar1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/36?cb=20101120015034\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"36\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff5 Bar1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff5_Bar1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"1500 gil\"><img alt=\"1500 gil\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"+1 KP when conditions are met\"><img alt=\"+1 KP when conditions are met\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"D012 Emblem Purple.png\" data-image-key=\"D012_Emblem_Purple.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/13/D012_Emblem_Purple.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209050509\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Thief\"><img alt=\"Capricious Thief\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Destruction Resin\"><img alt=\"Destruction Resin\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>As we open, Zidane and Bartz decide to turn the Crystal search into a treasure hunt to see who can get theirs first.\n</p><p>Straight Chain on the purple emblem at C3, naturally. It's a KP +1 emblem, score! The KP Chance is a 90 second win. Until Zidane picks up Tempest, I recommend relying on Rumble Rush for offense. It won't take long to hit Level 4, and Rumble Rush just flat does more damage. Bartz is your Assist for the first two gateways, his aerial Assist is annoying through because it wall rushes the opponent <i>up</i>, and unless you're in a small arena like Kefka's Tower or Pandaemonium, the foe will be out of your reach. Fortunately the attack lasts a couple seconds so you can land an HP hit during the animation if you're just using your Assist to get an opening for such.\n</p><p>First, an Idle Sky Pirate with Crossbow, Shield &amp; Sword, and Inferno. Next, a Capricious Reaper with Ring Holy, Burst Energy and Flare Star. Third is a Capricious Thief with Rumble Rush, Storm Impulse, a forward spinning attack in the air, and Stellar Circle 5, a spinning tornado of energy on the ground. The last foe is a Fallacious Wanderer with Reel Impulse, Holy, and Dark Flame. He also has the accessory gimmick of Zidane's chapter, a Hyper Ring with 9 BRV ≥ Base Value boosters. It gives them a pretty good damage boost at normal Bravery, but one hit and that 10.5x booster level drops to 1, so not very effective in practice.\n</p><p>With the opposition cleaned up and 33 KP in your pocket, grab the chest for Destruction Resin and 1500 gil, then head to the exit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Trap\">The Trap</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Trap\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_17?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Trap\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On the world map, you're in familiar territory, near the desert where we began Squall's tale - in fact, the gateway we just left is the same one Squall began in. So as we did there turn around and go back and to the right to find a False Stalwart that needs killing urgently. Zidane's Rumble Rush is his world map attack, it has decent range and lasts a second or so, so it's pretty effective to get first strike. The sealed gateway nearby is the one Squall took, but as I said we're going in a different direction. There's an EX Charge beyond the Stalwart. Going ahead now there's a familiar rock to smash to get to a familiar strip of land. The left end from where you grind over has a chest with a Pink Tail. On the mainland go through the mountains to find a stronger Stalwart to beat. The grass nearby conceals a Rosetta Stone, and the island far over the rock grindbar has a KP Gambler. Now there's just the next gateway to tackle.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"2000 gil\"><img alt=\"2000 gil\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Reaper\"><img alt=\"Capricious Reaper\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Wanderer\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Thief\"><img alt=\"Capricious Thief\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\"